+/-
+The former declarations `fib_carmichael_large` and an unbounded two-argument
+`fib_carmichael` were removed from active code because their proofs merely called
+`Shared.fib_carmichael_composite` outside its computationally verified range.
+That did not establish the required growth estimate for indices above `10000`.
+The faithful theorem below records exactly the range proved by this development.
+-/
 
